    <name>Speed Threshold Ladder 25 to 75 MPH</name>
    <desc>1 Hz threshold ladder: 0-75 mph ramp at exactly 1 mph/s (25 mph fix at t=25 s, 75 mph fix at t=75 s), 15 s hold at 75, ramp to 80 (over a 70 limit), 10 s hold at 80, decel to 45, 9 s hold at 45.</desc>
